id: CTB-SRC0033-i6
source: SRC-0033
section: §2.6
kind: requirement
scope: ARC
title: Constitutional invariant I6: technology agnosticism
applied-in: STG-00.A-1
distinct-from: LXM-REQ-000041, LXM-REQ-000042, LXM-REQ-000043, LXM-REQ-000049, LXM-REQ-000136, LXM-REQ-000195, LXM-REQ-000242, LXM-REQ-000243
text: Technology agnosticism is constitutional invariant I6: technologies and providers sit behind contracts and adapters, and the core names none. The technology governance gate and a scan of the core check it in CI.
